{title: Are You Washed In The Blood}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse 1}
Have you [G]been to Jesus for the [C]cleansing power
Are you [G]washed in the blood of the [D]lamb
Are you [G]fully trusting in his [C]grace this hour
Are you [G]washed in the [D]blood of the [G]lamb

{comment: Chorus}
[G]Are you washed (are you washed)
In the [C]blood (in the blood)
In the [G]soul cleansing blood of the [D]lamb
Are your [G]garments spotless are they [C]white as snow
Are you [G]washed in the [D]blood of the [G]lamb

{comment: Verse 2}
[G]Are you walking daily by the [C]Savior's side
Are you [G]washed in the blood of the [D]lamb
Do you [G]rest each moment in the [C]Crucified
Are you [G]washed in the [D]blood of the [G]lamb

{comment: Verse 3}
[G]When the bridegroom cometh will your [C]robes be white
Pure and [G]white in the blood of the [D]lamb
Will your [G]soul be ready for the mansions [C]bright
And be [G]washed in the [D]blood of the [G]lamb

{comment: Verse 4}
[G]Lay aside the garments that are [C]stained with sin
And be [G]washed in the blood of the [D]lamb
There's a [G]fountain flowing for the [C]soul unclean
Oh be [G]washed in the [D]blood of the [G]lamb
